// t_80dad2dd: the colour store that does NOT come from lowerStoreOutput.
//
// Two returns under a condition are merged into one predicated select, and
// lowerMergedReturnSelect builds that store itself.  It is therefore the
// one writer the three colour folds never see, so a half stamp applied only
// inside lowerStoreOutput misses it: the shader ACCEPTS with its colour in
// fp32 R0 and outputFromH0 clear, which is worse than the refusal it
// replaced, because a refusal is visible and this is not.
//
// Found by codex reviewing the mechanism before it had a sha.  Measured
// against the reference: outputFromH0=1.
half4 main(float4 t : TEXCOORD0) : COLOR
{
	if (t.x > 0.5)
		return t;
	return t.wzyx;
}
